WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:01.359
I have a confession.

2
00:00:01.719 --> 00:00:05.980
Twenty minutes ago, I gave an agent a
job, and now I don't even remember why.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.439
I know that while I was waiting, I
started another, and then another,

4
00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:15.539
and I realized that the hard part was
keeping track in my head of what each one

5
00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:19.739
was about, if it was still running,
or if it needed me to do something.

6
00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:23.939
With the Omnica timeline,
you don't have to remember.

7
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:27.639
You just have to look and see
what all of your agents are doing.

8
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Here's that one I forgot about.

9
00:00:30.719 --> 00:00:33.699
I can see what it's working on, and
I can see that it's still going,

10
00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:35.239
so I'll just let it be.

11
00:00:36.259 --> 00:00:40.459
Meanwhile, this one finished, and it
gave me a clear summary of what it did,

12
00:00:40.979 --> 00:00:43.200
what I can try out,
and what are the things

13
00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:45.200
that actually need me to make a decision.

14
00:00:46.439 --> 00:00:49.860
Want to manage your agents
without babysitting them?

15
00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:53.559
Sign up for the Omnica beta today
and help shape what comes next.
